{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_5_level_main_05-01_beg",
  "groupId": "main_5",
  "stageId": "main_05-01",
  "title": "冤家易結",
  "storyCode": "5-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9fa9211fd4e57d464ac3f3b941ada5a694304a6cf3bb203f7d9a13f0ca841e05",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "以後我們就是朋友了。現在那些大人們，再也沒辦法欺負我們了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "別害怕，從今天開始無論發生什麼，我都會幫你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "如果我遇到什麼壞事情，你可也一定要幫我哦！這就是朋友！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我們不會分開的，對吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你還記得那個老公爵擄走她時你做了什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你為了龍門能做到哪一步，是否真的什麼都可以？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "現在，魏彥吾，你又要犧牲誰、犧牲什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "唔......呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂，醒醒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "救她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "陳警司，醒醒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......讓我過去！讓我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "*龍門粗口*，我哪有時間和你這麼耗下去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嘩啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "噗，咳，咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "醒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "怎麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "星熊，快！整合運動——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "白日夢做夠了嗎？真是的，一臉敗相。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "怎麼是你？我的隊伍呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "如果我說全滅了呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "想挨打的話，建議去整合運動後面排隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嘴上功夫一直厲害得很，戰場上怎麼見不到你這麼凶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "你們怎麼回事？我才走開一小會兒，你們兩個就又吵架吵成這個樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "Miss.詩懷雅，少諷刺她兩句對你沒壞處，真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "老陳你也是，才剛醒就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "等等，你怎麼濕得跟剛被園藝車澆過一樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你問她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "“小姐”，這空杯子是怎麼回事？我記得我給你們兩個人各倒了一杯水？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "她作夢的時候亂說話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "搞什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我們在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "text": "羅德島的某個艙室。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "三刻鐘前，陳警司，你和你的小隊逃竄回了龍門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "text": "你可能覺得你們把自己的行蹤隱藏得很好，但徘徊在龍門外圍的整合運動並不這麼想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
